{"seq":38,"slug":"pingan","title":"平安集团企业文化与管理哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":29,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.11,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"平安集团企业文化与管理哲学-简介\">平安集团企业文化与管理哲学 简介</h1><p>平安集团（中国平安）自1988年深圳蛇口创立以来，从13人的地方保险公司成长为全球市值领先的综合金融集团。本知识库不写公关式的成功学，而是把平安拆成一套<strong>可被分析、可被对照、可被借鉴的管理系统</strong>：危机意识如何固化为制度、高压绩效如何驱动万亿增长、综合金融与科技转型如何被同一套组织逻辑串起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么，不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>平安这一家公司的文化基因、绩效制度、组织架构、战略方法论、职级薪酬、各角色成长路径与 AI 转型</strong>——即&quot;在平安内部，事情是怎么运转的、人是怎么活的&quot;。它不讲通用的管理学理论本身，也不讲行业宏观；这些请走对应的兄弟/跨学科 hub：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想了解的</th>\n<th>去哪里</th>\n<th>本 hub 的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平安这家公司怎么管、怎么干</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub</strong></td>\n<td>主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>另一家中国巨头的对照样本</td>\n<td><a href=\"../huawei/\">华为</a>、<a href=\"../cmb/\">招商银行</a>、<a href=\"../ant-group/\">蚂蚁集团</a></td>\n<td>横向对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用战略/变革/组织/绩效理论</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../management/strategic-management/\">战略管理</a>、<a href=\"../../management/change-management/\">变革管理</a>、<a href=\"../../management/engineering-management/\">工程管理</a></td>\n<td>理论支撑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金融风险、估值、公司金融原理</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../economics-finance/financial-risk-management/\">金融风险管理</a>、<a href=\"../../economics-finance/corporate-finance/\">公司金融</a></td>\n<td>专业底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金融科技的 AI/Agent 技术本身</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../ai-llm/ai-agent-development/\">AI Agent 开发</a>、<a href=\"../../ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/\">AI 基础设施</a></td>\n<td>技术底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体如何在高压组织生存</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../management/resilience-stress-management/\">抗压与韧性</a>、<a href=\"../../management/career-advancement/\">职业进阶</a></td>\n<td>个人应对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"七章结构\">七章结构</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>文化与价值观</strong> —— 危机意识、马明哲领导力、科技驱动文化、使命愿景、狼性文化、自我颠覆、全球化野心。</li>\n<li><strong>绩效考核体系</strong> —— 高压 KPI、末位淘汰与激进目标、联席 CEO 制。</li>\n<li><strong>组织与人才</strong> —— 综合金融人才体系、科技人才引入、组织架构。</li>\n<li><strong>战略与方法论</strong> —— 综合金融、科技赋能、医疗健康生态。</li>\n<li><strong>职级体系与薪酬</strong> —— 双通道职级、薪酬结构、绩效考核、职场生存指南。</li>\n<li><strong>各角色成长路线</strong> —— 工程师、精算师、财富顾问、产品经理、风控合规。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 变革与智能化转型</strong> —— AI 保险、AI 金融服务、AI 医疗、AI 职业机会。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><p><strong>管理者 / 组织文化研究者</strong>：先读第一章（文化基因）→ 第二章（绩效制度如何承接文化）→ 第三、四章（组织与战略如何放大文化），把平安当作&quot;危机意识驱动型组织&quot;的完整案例。建议与 <a href=\"../huawei/\">华为</a> 对照阅读——两套&quot;狼性&quot;截然不同。</p>\n<p><strong>求职者 / 在职员工</strong>：直接从第五章（职级薪酬）→ 第六章（你所在角色的成长路线）→ 第二章（看清你将面对的绩效红线）。第五章的<a href=\"level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide\">职场生存指南</a>是务实的避坑起点。</p>\n<p><strong>金融科技从业者 / 技术人</strong>：第四章第二节（科技赋能）→ 第七章（AI 全景）→ 第六章第一节（工程师路线）。这条线展示一家传统金融集团如何把自己重做成&quot;金融+科技&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：对企业组织、KPI/绩效考核有基本概念即可，正文不假设金融或管理专业背景。</li>\n<li><strong>加分</strong>：了解综合金融（保险+银行+投资牌照协同）与基本金融术语（偿付能力、客均合同数）会读得更顺；可参考<a href=\"../../economics-finance/corporate-finance/\">公司金融</a>与<a href=\"../../economics-finance/financial-risk-management/\">金融风险管理</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第七章额外加分</strong>：了解大模型与智能体的基本概念，可先看<a href=\"../../ai-llm/ai-agent-development/\">AI Agent 开发</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crisis-awareness","title":"危机意识与永远的创业精神","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/crisis-awareness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ma-mingzhe-leadership","title":"马明哲的铁腕领导力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/ma-mingzhe-leadership"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-driven-culture","title":"科技驱动的转型文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/tech-driven-culture"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"平安使命愿景价值观：从\"专业让生活更简单\"到\"综合金融+科技\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values"},{"seq":5,"slug":"wolf-culture","title":"平安的狼性文化：高压竞争与结果导向的极致追求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/wolf-culture"},{"seq":6,"slug":"innovation-and-disruption","title":"创新与自我颠覆：从保险公司到综合金融科技集团","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/innovation-and-disruption"},{"seq":7,"slug":"global-ambition","title":"全球化野心：平安的国际化布局与世界500强定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/culture-and-values/global-ambition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效考核体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"high-pressure-kpi","title":"高压绩效考核体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/performance-system/high-pressure-kpi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elimination-mechanism","title":"末位淘汰与激进目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/performance-system/elimination-mechanism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"co-ceo-system","title":"联席 CEO 制与权力分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/performance-system/co-ceo-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"comprehensive-finance-talent","title":"综合金融人才体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/org-and-talent/comprehensive-finance-talent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tech-talent-acquisition","title":"科技人才引入战略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/org-and-talent/tech-talent-acquisition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-architecture","title":"综合金融组织架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/org-and-talent/org-architecture"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"comprehensive-finance","title":"综合金融战略布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/strategy-and-methodology/comprehensive-finance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tech-empowerment","title":"科技赋能金融：平安科技的战略角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/strategy-and-methodology/tech-empowerment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"healthcare-ecosystem","title":"医疗健康生态战略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/strategy-and-methodology/healthcare-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"职级体系与薪酬","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-level-system","title":"平安职级体系：管理序列与专业序列的双通道设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/level-and-compensation/career-level-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"平安薪酬结构：基本工资、绩效奖金与子公司差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"平安绩效考核：强制分布、末位淘汰与KPI地狱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"平安职场生存指南：适应高压文化与避坑策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"role-career-paths","title":"各角色成长与晋升路线","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/role-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering","title":"科技工程师成长路线：从初级开发到技术领袖的全路径解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/role-career-paths/engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"insurance-actuary","title":"保险精算师成长路线：平安精算体系与职业发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/role-career-paths/insurance-actuary"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wealth-advisor","title":"财富顾问与理财师成长路线：从保险代理人到高净值客户顾问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/role-career-paths/wealth-advisor"},{"seq":4,"slug":"product-manager","title":"产品经理成长路线：金融产品与科技产品的双轨发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/role-career-paths/product-manager"},{"seq":5,"slug":"risk-and-compliance","title":"风控与合规成长路线：金融行业的\"守门人\"角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/role-career-paths/risk-and-compliance"}]},{"seq":7,"slug":"ai-transformation","title":"AI 变革与智能化转型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/ai-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-insurance-innovation","title":"AI 保险创新：从人工核保到秒级智能决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/ai-transformation/ai-insurance-innovation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-financial-services","title":"AI 金融服务：智能投顾、信贷风控与反欺诈体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/ai-transformation/ai-financial-services"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-healthcare","title":"AI 医疗健康：从平安好医生到全病程智能管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/ai-transformation/ai-healthcare"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-career-opportunities","title":"AI 时代的综合金融科技职业机遇","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pingan/ai-transformation/ai-career-opportunities"}]}]}